<title>FINLAND: KESKO MAY SALES UP 6.2 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>KESKO MAY SALES UP 6.2 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish wholesaler and retailer Kesko Oy said in a statement on Monday that group sales excluding value-added-tax (VAT) increased 6.2 percent year-on-year in May to 2.96 billion markka.  </p>
<p>Kesko's daily goods sales fell 4.3 percent in May on the year-ago period to 1.45 billion markka while sales of hardware and agriculture goods rose 9.9 percent to 790 million markka.</p>
<p>The group's January-May sales rose 26.2 percent year-on-year to 14.92 billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
